CONTENT3.setdefault("postgresql", {})["rls_mask"] = {'zh': {'v': '有', 'p': '原生RLS+列级权限，脱敏靠扩展', 'b': '- PostgreSQL 9.5+ 提供原生行级安全：CREATE POLICY 绑定表，按 current_user 等会话变量做行过滤 `官方文档`\n- 支持列级权限 GRANT SELECT(col) 与 SECURITY DEFINER 视图封装；BYPASSRLS 权限须严格管控，否则策略被绕过 `官方文档`\n- 动态脱敏无内置组件，通常靠 pg_anonymizer 扩展、视图 CASE 表达式或应用层实现 `社区共识`\n- RLS 与分区表、外键、物化视图交互有坑：策略表达式性能差会拖慢查询，需实测 `社区实测`'}, 'en': {'v': 'Supported', 'p': 'Native RLS + column grants; masking via extensions', 'b': '- PostgreSQL 9.5+ ships native row-level security: CREATE POLICY on tables filters rows by session variables like current_user `(official docs)`\n- Column-level GRANT SELECT(col) and SECURITY DEFINER views are supported; the BYPASSRLS privilege must be locked down or policies are bypassed `(official docs)`\n- No built-in dynamic masking; typically done with the pg_anonymizer extension, CASE expressions in views, or the app layer `(community consensus)`\n- RLS interacts poorly with partitioned tables, foreign keys, and materialized views; slow policy expressions drag down queries, so test in practice `(community tested)`'}}
